claim.claim-text:
determining, based on a rate at which received signal strength of beacon signals from a wireless device varies with time, whether the wireless device is in motion;
determining, based on whether the wireless device is in motion, a received signal strength averaging window; and
estimating a location of the wireless device based on additional beacon signals from the wireless device received during the received signal strength averaging window.

determine, based on a rate at which received signal strength of beacon signals from a wireless device varies with time, whether the wireless device is in motion;
determine, based on whether the wireless device is in motion, a received signal strength averaging window; and
estimate a location of the wireless device based on additional beacon signals from the wireless device received during the received signal strength averaging window.
